=2 Walkthrough
* Head to {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point} in {z:Caedarva Mire}.
** **If you go south from the Cutter and zone into {z:Caedarva Mire} you will be very close to the staging point.**
* Enter {p:Periqia} via the Runic Seal just West from where you arrive at {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point}.
** If you do not have {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point} <-- click the link for how to unlock it.
* This fight is against up to 10x {m:K23H1-LAMIA} that you will encounter near H-9. After enough are defeated, a random amount, the battle ends.
** Trusts may be summoned.
** All the {m:K23H1-LAMIA} are located together at (H-9).
** They all have true sight and link.
** They can be slept for crowd control.
** All of the {m:K23H1-LAMIA} attacks have the added effect of {s:Poison}.
** They can also use the {p:WS} **Venomous Tail** which has a very strong {s:Poison} effect (at least 80 {p:HP} a tick).
* Upon winning this battle, you'll receive a **cutscene** that finish this mission.
** If you fail the battle, you can obtain another permit to enter from {n:Nahshib} after one game day.

>**{c=red:Note}**:
* If you have already finished this mission, you do not need another permit to help others with it.

